1
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,880
- Mr. Ahn! - Mr. Ahn!

2
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,140
Please say something.

3
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:16,440
I have somehing to say about the great lawyer Ahn Do Hoon.

4
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:19,500
- Please make a comment. - Stop! Stop it!

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,540
- That's enough. - What?

6
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:35,050
San... Don't you want to see him?

7
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:44,470
San... Your son. Don't you miss him?

8
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:54,760
How dare you! How dare you mention his name?

9
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:02,800
If he's alive,

10
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:07,330
how come I don't even know about it.

11
00:02:12,410 --> 00:02:14,580
How can you take San as an excuse?

12
00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:19,760
I did it for you and Do Hoon.

13
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:23,130
He's alive. Trust me.

14
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:26,140
You need to care about yourselves.

15
00:02:26,140 --> 00:02:29,550
How could you live as a single mom

16
00:02:29,550 --> 00:02:31,880
and an ex-convict?

17
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:37,440
You and Do Hoon weren't meant to be together.

18
00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:41,690
How can you take care of a boy that was born in jail?

19
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:45,950
You protect your son in that way,

20
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:51,660
how can you do this to my son?

21
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:56,020
So what if he was born in jail?

22
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:59,180
So what if I'm an ex-convict?

23
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:02,520
I can't raise him by my own?

24
00:03:03,730 --> 00:03:06,870
What if his father's a murderer?

25
00:03:07,770 --> 00:03:12,170
Bring him to me.

26
00:03:12,170 --> 00:03:17,530
Where is San? Where is he?

27
00:03:17,530 --> 00:03:28,840
Bring him back to me! Bring him back to me!

28
00:03:30,070 --> 00:03:38,200
Why? Why?

29
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:47,390
Why? Why?

30
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:57,450
It's cold.

31
00:03:57,450 --> 00:04:00,430
Long time no see. You must attend the meeting this time.

32
00:04:18,490 --> 00:04:20,500
Mom.

33
00:04:23,030 --> 00:04:25,490
- Mom. - What's she doing?

34
00:04:27,250 --> 00:04:30,230
Hey! What are you doing to my son?

35
00:04:30,990 --> 00:04:32,550
Jung Hwan, are you okay?

36
00:04:33,370 --> 00:04:35,770
San.

37
00:04:37,290 --> 00:04:39,450
His name is San.

38
00:04:39,450 --> 00:04:41,600
- Jung Hwan, let's go. - He's San.

39
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:44,120
What are you doing?

40
00:04:47,790 --> 00:04:50,910
Let me go.

41
00:04:51,730 --> 00:04:53,260
Yoo Jung!

42
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:57,120
Look at him.

43
00:04:57,120 --> 00:05:00,020
Look what you've taken away from me.

44
00:05:03,050 --> 00:05:06,520
I didn't know. Trust me.

45
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:11,610
Don't say that you didn't know.

46
00:05:11,610 --> 00:05:13,930
You could've found out.

47
00:05:13,930 --> 00:05:16,180
When you heard that San was dead,

48
00:05:16,180 --> 00:05:18,230
you didn't even see the body.

49
00:05:18,230 --> 00:05:20,550
Why didn't you go to see him?

50
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:24,350
While your mother was doing this,

51
00:05:24,350 --> 00:05:26,600
you just pretend knowing nothing.

52
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:30,120
How can you say you didn't know? How can you?

53
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:55,840
Ja Yeong. San didn't recognize me.

54
00:05:58,220 --> 00:06:01,280
How could he not recognize his own mother?

55
00:06:07,060 --> 00:06:10,080
How is it possible?

56
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:20,860
I need to get him back.

57
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,820
I'll get him back.

58
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:27,120
Sure. You gave birth to him and breastfed him.

59
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:30,560
You should get him back. That bastard.

60
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:33,500
Ja Yeong! Where are you going?

61
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:36,470
What are you going to do? Beat them up?

62
00:06:36,470 --> 00:06:38,360
It might make you feel better,

63
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,530
but it won't help Yoo Jung.

64
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,710
Hae Ri, don't just stand there.

65
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:53,250
Go get some water.

66
00:06:57,810 --> 00:07:01,500
Do you remember that old lady

67
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:04,080
who was in the next room when we were in jail?

68
00:07:05,490 --> 00:07:09,380
She's an expert in fabricating documents.

69
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:12,410
She knows a lot of techinicians in this field.

70
00:07:12,410 --> 00:07:14,130
Let's contact her.

71
00:07:14,130 --> 00:07:16,980
We can find out who forged

72
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:20,440
San's death certificate.

73
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:23,210
Let's find that bastard.

74
00:07:26,130 --> 00:07:28,860
How could you do that?

75
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:32,450
How could you do such a thing to her?

76
00:07:32,830 --> 00:07:35,150
- I did it for Do Hoon. - Stop!

77
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:38,390
You only think about Do Hoon.

78
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:40,920
That's why Do Hoon ended up like this.

79
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:48,070
What should I do? How can I face Yoo Jung?

80
00:07:56,180 --> 00:07:57,950
What have you done?

81
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,900
We have his death certificate.

82
00:08:03,730 --> 00:08:06,370
Do you know what you've done?

83
00:08:08,230 --> 00:08:13,540
Well... A friend who I met in the sauna,

84
00:08:13,540 --> 00:08:16,970
- said her niece doesn't have a baby. - Mother.

85
00:08:19,210 --> 00:08:21,500
I did it for you.

86
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:24,340
I didn't do it for me.

87
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:27,710
Do you think it was easy for me?

88
00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:31,930
How could you raise him at that moment?

89
00:08:31,930 --> 00:08:34,920
Why not send him to a good family?

90
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,410
Excuse me.

91
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:40,890
Excuse me.

92
00:08:42,210 --> 00:08:44,250
We're from the police station.

93
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:49,190
What's going on?

94
00:08:49,190 --> 00:08:52,820
Well... Ms. Park Gyeok.

95
00:08:55,550 --> 00:08:58,890
Park Gyeok. You know who Mr. Lee Sangcheol is.

96
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:06,410
Mr. Lee said that you paid him 3 million KRW,

97
00:09:06,410 --> 00:09:10,880
to fabricate a document. Is that true?

98
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:19,230
The victim reported it to the police.

99
00:09:20,250 --> 00:09:28,190
Anyway, we're arresting you for fabricating a document and using it.

100
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:33,720
Wait! Even if it's true, this is her first offense.

101
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:36,360
Can you investigate without detaining her?

102
00:09:37,730 --> 00:09:40,020
I'm his grandmother.

103
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,650
I did it for everybody.

104
00:09:41,650 --> 00:09:43,900
I didn't mean to do this.

105
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:47,330
Everyone has his own reasons.

106
00:09:48,340 --> 00:09:52,170
You have to come with me anyway.

107
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:55,140
Wait!

108
00:09:55,170 --> 00:09:56,360
- Do Hoon! Do Hoon!

109
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:59,080
- Honey! Honey! - Dear! Dear!

110
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:02,950
- Detective! Dear! Dear! - Do Hoon! Do Hoon!

111
00:10:03,930 --> 00:10:06,610
Are you just going to let her go like that?

112
00:10:06,610 --> 00:10:09,000
Do something about it.

113
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:15,100
What can I do?

114
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:22,760
Dear! Dear!

115
00:10:30,170 --> 00:10:32,900
What? What is it?

116
00:10:40,810 --> 00:10:42,140
What is it?

117
00:10:45,230 --> 00:10:47,600
You want to say something. Say it!

118
00:10:48,190 --> 00:10:53,460
- Ms. Kang's son is alive. - What?

119
00:10:59,710 --> 00:11:01,380
Mrs. Park Gyeok.

120
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:06,930
Someone is here for you.

121
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,930
In order to get rid of me,

122
00:11:24,930 --> 00:11:27,840
you said San was dead.

123
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:31,210
Now you tell me that San isn't dead,

124
00:11:31,210 --> 00:11:33,980
do you think I'd be grateful

125
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:39,750
and forgive Do Hoon at once?

126
00:11:39,750 --> 00:11:42,520
That was the best choice at that time.

127
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:44,650
You were so young at that time.

128
00:11:44,650 --> 00:11:47,300
Suffer the same thing

129
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:50,290
as my father did.

130
00:11:51,170 --> 00:11:55,120
I want you to see Do Hoon wither away in jail.

131
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,600
Just imagine it.

132
00:11:57,600 --> 00:12:02,480
Yoo Jung, Do Hoon didn't do anything wrong. I did everything.

133
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:06,370
If your son is so precious to you,

134
00:12:07,670 --> 00:12:10,730
how could you do that to me?

135
00:12:12,150 --> 00:12:15,250
They're taking good care of San.

136
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:18,440
I visit them every month.

137
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:22,560
They let me have dinner with San, and said I'm his grandma.

138
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:24,700
They are good people.

139
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:30,900
What about me? Don't you think I would've done the same?

140
00:12:34,130 --> 00:12:37,260
I want you to know how painful it is

141
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:42,510
not to be able to see your son even when he is alive.

142
00:12:43,210 --> 00:12:46,060
Just experience it yourself.

143
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:50,350
Yoo Jung!

144
00:12:50,630 --> 00:12:54,730
Yoo Jung! Yoo Jung!

145
00:13:13,170 --> 00:13:15,120
Please.

146
00:13:16,010 --> 00:13:20,230
Don't take Jung Hwan away from me.

147
00:13:20,490 --> 00:13:26,070
I never abandoned San.

148
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:30,760
If I'd known that his birth mother was alive,

149
00:13:30,940 --> 00:13:33,200
I would've come to you.

150
00:13:34,010 --> 00:13:38,640
When he was old enough to understand...

151
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:44,580
I was going to tell him what really happened.

152
00:13:44,910 --> 00:13:47,190
I didn't mean to lie to him.

153
00:13:47,550 --> 00:13:53,640
He's not old enough to understand.

154
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:57,870
It's not too late.

155
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:01,830
No!

156
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:06,150
I can't let him go.

157
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:09,960
No...

158
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:17,370
I can't give up Jung Hwan. Please!

159
00:14:32,650 --> 00:14:34,990
I can't give up either.

160
00:14:35,810 --> 00:14:41,210
I can't give up San.

161
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:44,940
No.

162
00:14:47,610 --> 00:14:50,310
No.

163
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:58,260
Stop drinking.

164
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:03,480
Stop drinking.

165
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:06,550
Are you trying to kill yourself again?

166
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:12,860
Right. If I died at that time,

167
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:18,120
I wouldn't have to see you become such a person today.

168
00:15:18,340 --> 00:15:20,300
Mom will be released soon.

169
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:23,520
This is her first offence. She'll just be fined.

170
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,540
Unbelievable!

171
00:15:27,770 --> 00:15:33,130
How can you and your mother be so cruel?

172
00:15:33,310 --> 00:15:36,960
That's because you're too weak.

173
00:15:39,060 --> 00:15:46,020
That's right. It's all my fault.

174
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,800
You're right.

175
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:55,670
Gwang Min!

176
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:02,020
What are you doing? Your father is waiting for him.

177
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:04,040
No, I need to see him first.

178
00:16:04,170 --> 00:16:04,990
Min Joo.

179
00:16:05,180 --> 00:16:07,890
We haven't celebrated your birthday.

180
00:16:08,220 --> 00:16:11,290
Come here. I've got presents for you.

181
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:14,620
Look!

182
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,620
Is this your present?

183
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:24,990
I heard that you liked it. Don't you?

184
00:16:28,100 --> 00:16:30,150
I do.

185
00:16:30,550 --> 00:16:32,240
That's great.

186
00:16:46,250 --> 00:16:50,880
I went to find my father with Kwang Soo in winter.

187
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:54,040
We couldn't find him, and we were hungry.

188
00:16:54,670 --> 00:16:56,930
While I was crying like a baby,

189
00:16:57,690 --> 00:17:02,630
your father came and bought us some noodles.

190
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:06,170
It was so delicious.

191
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:12,760
What's this?

192
00:17:13,350 --> 00:17:15,970
Wait. I'll prepare something for you to eat.

193
00:17:16,770 --> 00:17:18,950
He said he wanted to eat this.

194
00:17:19,450 --> 00:17:21,780
Just care about your daughter.

195
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:24,230
You said I'm too fat, you don't even want me to eat.

196
00:17:24,430 --> 00:17:26,910
You should lose another 2kg.

197
00:17:27,120 --> 00:17:29,470
Do you want to look fat in your graduation photo?

198
00:17:29,730 --> 00:17:32,400
Min Joo, don't eat those noodles.

199
00:17:36,670 --> 00:17:40,310
Gwang Min, she's like a stepmother to me.

200
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:46,720
Why are you looking at me like this?

201
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:50,000
Let it go. I already know.

202
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:52,430
I've known since middle school.

203
00:17:52,760 --> 00:17:55,290
You've known all along?

204
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,060
Yes.

205
00:17:57,390 --> 00:17:59,450
When I tell her that she acts like a stepmother,

206
00:17:59,590 --> 00:18:02,560
She looks like the heroine in the tragedy.

207
00:18:03,060 --> 00:18:05,630
She's pretty at that time.

208
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:09,510
And she'll treat me better.

209
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:12,240
I was angry in the beginning,

210
00:18:12,670 --> 00:18:16,400
but she's still my mother, right?

211
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:50,500
He had a blanket with the moon and stars on it.

212
00:18:51,690 --> 00:18:54,020
Wait.

213
00:19:08,210 --> 00:19:10,060
Here.

214
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:21,680
When he first came here, he couldn't sleep without it.

215
00:19:22,560 --> 00:19:25,220
It's too old.

216
00:19:29,090 --> 00:19:31,870
Can I take it with me?

217
00:19:32,790 --> 00:19:35,460
I'm home.

218
00:19:36,130 --> 00:19:38,750
Jung Hwan, why are you so early?

219
00:19:38,970 --> 00:19:40,800
Does your stomach hurt again?

220
00:19:41,050 --> 00:19:43,050
If you're sick like this, mommy...

221
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:45,360
Mommy will hurt as well.

222
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:48,100
Mommy will hurt as well?

223
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:52,850
Who is she?

224
00:20:01,530 --> 00:20:05,990
Mommy, why are you crying?

225
00:20:07,620 --> 00:20:09,510
Are you felling uncomfortable?

226
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:12,940
Why?

227
00:20:13,730 --> 00:20:17,140
Did she hurt you?

228
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:21,080
No, it's me.

229
00:20:22,250 --> 00:20:24,620
She didn't do anything wrong.

230
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:32,540
I think she did. Should I tell her to leave?

231
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:50,770
The trial is set for next week.

232
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:55,170
I'll see you then.

233
00:21:38,150 --> 00:21:41,230
I made it for him,

234
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:45,730
but he can sleep well without it now.

235
00:21:46,350 --> 00:21:49,660
He's allergic to crab meat.

236
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:56,460
If he's not happy, he'll tear up paper.

237
00:21:56,820 --> 00:22:01,600
He rides a bike with his father on weekends.

238
00:22:02,050 --> 00:22:03,770
Did you know?

239
00:22:04,150 --> 00:22:05,470
Yoo Jung.

240
00:22:05,810 --> 00:22:09,120
I didn't know any of that. He's my son.

241
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:14,910
He's my San.

242
00:22:15,490 --> 00:22:21,170
I don't know what he likes, how he grew up.

243
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:25,670
I don't know anything.

244
00:22:26,010 --> 00:22:28,790
What should I do?

245
00:22:29,450 --> 00:22:32,570
You still don't know?

246
00:22:58,770 --> 00:23:00,650
Aren't you coming home again tonight?

247
00:23:00,850 --> 00:23:03,500
I'm thinking about the painting to sen to Hannam-dong.

248
00:23:03,730 --> 00:23:07,190
You know how picky she is.

249
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:12,470
Don't run the gallery anymore.

250
00:23:13,390 --> 00:23:16,800
Buying and selling paintings isn't for you.

251
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:21,480
It's my job. What else can I do?

252
00:23:23,810 --> 00:23:31,860
I think you look the hapiest when you paint.

253
00:23:35,500 --> 00:23:39,430
I'm busy. Can you leave?

254
00:23:58,070 --> 00:24:00,260
Se Yeon.

255
00:24:01,250 --> 00:24:04,170
When I was devastated,

256
00:24:04,490 --> 00:24:07,280
is this how you felt?

257
00:24:08,370 --> 00:24:15,390
I want to do something for you, but I don't know what to do.

258
00:24:16,470 --> 00:24:21,240
I hope you can be happy again.

259
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:30,330
You and I were happy together.

260
00:24:31,050 --> 00:24:34,270
Not knowing that all the other kids hated us,

261
00:24:34,900 --> 00:24:37,840
We were hanging out together,

262
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:40,530
and we were happy at that time, right?

263
00:24:40,730 --> 00:24:42,760
Stop!

264
00:24:48,610 --> 00:24:51,480
I'm trying hard not to like you.

265
00:24:52,010 --> 00:24:55,450
Please stop.

266
00:25:22,060 --> 00:25:23,790
I'm sorry.

267
00:25:28,500 --> 00:25:30,270
I'm sorry.

268
00:25:40,740 --> 00:25:42,170
Are you happy to play outside?

269
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:48,310
- Are you happy? - Yes.

270
00:25:48,990 --> 00:25:50,070
Mommy made these rolls.

271
00:25:50,100 --> 00:25:51,090
Aren't they good?

272
00:25:51,130 --> 00:25:52,750
This one?

273
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:57,090
- Isn't it delicious? - Yes.

274
00:25:57,090 --> 00:25:58,530
It's the best, right?

275
00:26:05,060 --> 00:26:06,030
Jung Hwan.

276
00:26:16,630 --> 00:26:17,880
Jung Hwan.

277
00:26:29,420 --> 00:26:32,230
Madam. You're here again.

278
00:26:32,820 --> 00:26:35,380
Don't call me madam.

279
00:26:46,620 --> 00:26:48,690
I'm your auntie.

280
00:26:48,930 --> 00:26:51,740
I'm your mommy's friend.

281
00:27:03,430 --> 00:27:05,030
Go and play.

282
00:27:05,510 --> 00:27:07,350
See you next time.

283
00:27:08,310 --> 00:27:10,340
Jung Hwan.

284
00:27:15,350 --> 00:27:16,670
Go.

285
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:20,480
Daddy, I want to ride my bike.

286
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:22,490
Sure.

287
00:27:25,280 --> 00:27:26,420
Let's go.

288
00:27:27,110 --> 00:27:28,490
Hold on tight.

289
00:27:31,590 --> 00:27:33,090
Here we go.

290
00:27:49,520 --> 00:27:52,500
Thank you.

291
00:27:54,230 --> 00:27:55,360
Are you okay?

292
00:27:55,770 --> 00:27:57,040
Thank you.

293
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:11,100
Look what you've taken away from me.

294
00:28:12,540 --> 00:28:17,890
Look what you've been missing in your life.

295
00:28:19,190 --> 00:28:22,070
So good! So good!

296
00:28:24,870 --> 00:28:27,970
- After throwing away something precious, -Fighting!

297
00:28:29,580 --> 00:28:33,120
Look what happened to us.

298
00:28:36,660 --> 00:28:38,800
Look at it yourself.

299
00:29:11,070 --> 00:29:14,630
I'm sorry, Yoo Jung.

300
00:29:15,460 --> 00:29:26,290
It's all my fault. Sorry.

301
00:29:29,330 --> 00:29:35,110
Yoo Jung. Sorry. Sorry.

302
00:29:39,280 --> 00:29:43,360
It's all my fault.

303
00:29:55,210 --> 00:29:58,710
Sorry. Sorry.

304
00:29:59,620 --> 00:30:03,140
Idiot! Idiot! How can you abandon San?

305
00:30:03,140 --> 00:30:05,290
How are you going to live?

306
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:10,660
Ja Yeong, I didn't abandon him.

307
00:30:11,870 --> 00:30:17,690
I don't have to live with him simply because I'm his mother.

308
00:30:18,750 --> 00:30:23,080
If San is happy, that's all that matters.

309
00:30:27,670 --> 00:30:31,020
San looked so happy when he smiled.

310
00:30:31,490 --> 00:30:35,530
This is crazy. I don't know.

311
00:30:35,530 --> 00:30:37,680
If someone took my son away like that,

312
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:40,930
I'd chase them down to the end of the world.

313
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:47,610
I thought I'd do the same.

314
00:30:52,370 --> 00:30:54,980
But I couldn't.

315
00:30:56,590 --> 00:30:59,270
After they took San away from me,

316
00:30:59,270 --> 00:31:06,420
it hurts so much I thought I'd die.

317
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:12,480
I couldn't do it.

318
00:31:14,900 --> 00:31:21,030
When San first went to her place...

319
00:31:27,250 --> 00:31:29,920
He didn't stop crying.

320
00:31:31,740 --> 00:31:35,200
He didn't eat for a week

321
00:31:35,200 --> 00:31:38,500
while looking for me.

322
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:44,860
He kept on crying.

323
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:53,650
I couldn't possibly bring him back.

324
00:31:53,650 --> 00:31:59,670
What if he cried all day saying

325
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:04,750
that he missed his mommy?

326
00:32:58,070 --> 00:33:01,020
I guess I was wrong about myself.

327
00:33:03,140 --> 00:33:08,140
I thought I'd be okay even if you didn't love me.

328
00:33:09,230 --> 00:33:11,600
But I'm not okay.

329
00:33:13,290 --> 00:33:15,430
Let's end this.

330
00:33:15,430 --> 00:33:17,380
Se Yeon.

331
00:33:26,020 --> 00:33:28,340
Min Hyuk!

332
00:33:33,660 --> 00:33:36,000
Don't worry about me.

333
00:33:36,060 --> 00:33:38,450
I'm Shin Se Yeon.

334
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:57,430
You're giving your shares to Se Yeon?

335
00:33:57,430 --> 00:34:02,030
You two broke up and you want to give your shares to her?

336
00:34:02,030 --> 00:34:03,630
I'm leaving them not to Se Yeon,

337
00:34:03,630 --> 00:34:05,910
but to the Shina Foundation.

338
00:34:06,410 --> 00:34:08,230
I guess she'll use it wisely.

339
00:34:08,230 --> 00:34:09,500
Are you out of your mind?

340
00:34:09,500 --> 00:34:12,730
I'll give up my management right.

341
00:34:12,730 --> 00:34:13,720
Min Hyuk.

342
00:34:13,720 --> 00:34:15,580
Don't make a rash decision.

343
00:34:15,580 --> 00:34:17,330
It's not a rash decision.

344
00:34:17,330 --> 00:34:19,160
It's a reasonable one.

345
00:34:19,160 --> 00:34:22,090
You're better than me.

346
00:34:22,090 --> 00:34:26,390
I'm saying this, not as your son, but for the K Corporation.

347
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:28,560
So,

348
00:34:28,560 --> 00:34:33,630
you still want to be with that girl?

349
00:34:35,640 --> 00:34:37,990
No.

350
00:34:38,850 --> 00:34:41,640
I'd love to be with her,

351
00:34:41,640 --> 00:34:43,650
but I'm too ashamed.

352
00:34:43,650 --> 00:34:45,810
Ashamed?

353
00:34:45,810 --> 00:34:50,170
Everybody makes mistakes.

354
00:34:50,930 --> 00:34:55,000
It's important how you make up for them.

355
00:34:56,170 --> 00:34:58,680
That's what she said.

356
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:01,410
I

357
00:35:02,530 --> 00:35:05,250
want to make up for what I did.

358
00:35:05,250 --> 00:35:06,250
What?

359
00:35:06,250 --> 00:35:08,030
The most impoverished place.

360
00:35:08,030 --> 00:35:09,830
The place where no one wants to go.

361
00:35:09,830 --> 00:35:12,190
Send me there.

362
00:35:12,190 --> 00:35:15,280
I'll work hard.

363
00:35:32,980 --> 00:35:34,920
No.

364
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:39,160
I haven't paid off my debt, yet.

365
00:35:39,790 --> 00:35:40,880
Take it.

366
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:42,750
If not, he'll be angry with me.

367
00:35:42,750 --> 00:35:44,680
You can pay your debt later.

368
00:35:44,680 --> 00:35:47,960
Bit by bit.

369
00:35:48,400 --> 00:35:50,410
He can get through

370
00:35:50,410 --> 00:35:53,380
only when he hears from you.

371
00:36:00,030 --> 00:36:01,760
He

372
00:36:02,510 --> 00:36:05,430
is leaving for Armenia today.

373
00:36:07,070 --> 00:36:08,190
Is he leaving so soon?

374
00:36:08,190 --> 00:36:11,350
He won't be back for a while.

375
00:38:32,300 --> 00:38:34,170
Hey!

376
00:38:34,170 --> 00:38:37,090
What's going on?

377
00:38:37,240 --> 00:38:40,080
I'm going to close up the gallery, and leave.

378
00:38:41,100 --> 00:38:45,820
I want to see you before I leave.

379
00:38:46,830 --> 00:38:49,820
I guess you've heard about what I've done.

380
00:38:49,820 --> 00:38:52,780
You still want to see me after knowing that?

381
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:56,620
I'll be prosecuted next week.

382
00:38:57,460 --> 00:39:02,940
It was me who killed Seo Ji Hee,

383
00:39:03,520 --> 00:39:05,690
not me.

384
00:39:07,620 --> 00:39:10,700
That's why I want to see you.

385
00:39:12,100 --> 00:39:15,810
I thought I should tell you this.

386
00:39:15,860 --> 00:39:23,170
You didn't kill Ms. Seo Ji Hee. It was me.

387
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:31,630
I told President Jo that I'd marry Min Hyuk.

388
00:39:31,630 --> 00:39:36,020
You and Min Hyuk have to end up like this.

389
00:39:37,550 --> 00:39:39,170
I'm pregnant.

390
00:39:39,170 --> 00:39:42,100
We'll have a baby after our marriage.

391
00:39:42,100 --> 00:39:43,090
Hey!

392
00:39:43,090 --> 00:39:47,790
Do you think Min Hyuk's father will approve of that baby?

393
00:39:47,790 --> 00:39:52,470
Do you think he'll let you give birth to the baby?

394
00:39:58,070 --> 00:39:59,990
Take it.

395
00:40:00,550 --> 00:40:06,100
Min Hyuk's father doesn't know that you're pregnant.

396
00:40:06,690 --> 00:40:09,620
Should I go tell him now?

397
00:40:11,850 --> 00:40:13,330
Disappear.

398
00:40:13,330 --> 00:40:18,070
Disappear from Min Hyuk's life forever.

399
00:40:18,070 --> 00:40:20,260
This is my last warning.

400
00:40:20,260 --> 00:40:32,050
Next time, it won't be a warning.

401
00:40:32,050 --> 00:40:35,370
I didn't think she'd actually die.

402
00:40:35,370 --> 00:40:38,590
I wished she were dead.

403
00:40:40,210 --> 00:40:43,770
That's what I wished for.

404
00:40:46,130 --> 00:40:51,460
I thought I'd be happy if I could be with Min Hyuk.

405
00:40:52,700 --> 00:40:57,360
I guess Min Hyuk and I weren't meant to be together.

406
00:41:04,280 --> 00:41:06,160
Sorry.

407
00:41:06,160 --> 00:41:10,130
You happened to be involved to this

408
00:41:10,130 --> 00:41:14,500
in the wrong place at the wrong time.

409
00:41:17,600 --> 00:41:21,120
I've thought about why things turned out like this

410
00:41:21,230 --> 00:41:24,150
over and over again.

411
00:41:24,310 --> 00:41:27,270
If only I hadn't been there.

412
00:41:27,270 --> 00:41:29,130
If only it hadn't been raining.

413
00:41:29,130 --> 00:41:32,210
If only the truck hadn't appeared.

414
00:41:33,290 --> 00:41:35,820
I was so angry.

415
00:41:36,030 --> 00:41:40,370
I was angry at what happened to me,

416
00:41:41,580 --> 00:41:46,070
I was afraid everything I built up would collapse.

417
00:41:48,810 --> 00:41:51,070
Now I've lost Yoo Jung,

418
00:41:53,020 --> 00:41:55,560
my son.

419
00:41:56,420 --> 00:41:59,430
I've lost them forever.

420
00:41:59,860 --> 00:42:02,300
Do Hoon!

421
00:42:02,830 --> 00:42:05,620
I killed Seo Ji Hee.

422
00:42:05,660 --> 00:42:08,250
It's my fault.

423
00:42:10,180 --> 00:42:12,870
Thank you for everything.

424
00:42:13,550 --> 00:42:16,400
Have a nice trip.

425
00:42:21,970 --> 00:42:24,070
I heard...

426
00:42:25,990 --> 00:42:28,540
You didn't release

427
00:42:30,410 --> 00:42:33,480
the Shina Foundation files even till now.

428
00:42:39,080 --> 00:42:41,020
Thank you.

429
00:42:45,790 --> 00:42:48,460
I'm going to miss

430
00:42:51,630 --> 00:42:54,420
your paintings.

431
00:44:07,240 --> 00:44:12,480
Did you admit that you abandoned Mr. Kang Woo Chul last month?

432
00:44:12,540 --> 00:44:13,490
Yes.

433
00:44:13,490 --> 00:44:17,010
The hit-and-run case from four years ago.

434
00:44:17,010 --> 00:44:19,810
Do you admit that you were driving,

435
00:44:19,810 --> 00:44:24,830
instead of Ms. Kang who's already served time?

436
00:44:29,060 --> 00:44:30,480
I'm asking if you admit

437
00:44:30,480 --> 00:44:37,420
that you're responsible for Ms. Seo Ji Hee's death?

438
00:44:43,010 --> 00:44:46,140
Father, can I use your car today?

439
00:44:46,140 --> 00:44:48,560
Why do you use the car today?

440
00:44:48,560 --> 00:44:52,420
Do you have to go somewhere far?

441
00:44:52,720 --> 00:44:54,320
I have something to do.

442
00:44:54,320 --> 00:44:59,490
Right, if you don't want to be late, you need a car.

443
00:45:00,930 --> 00:45:03,300
Try to be nice this time.

444
00:45:03,300 --> 00:45:05,910
If you ruin it again...

445
00:45:05,910 --> 00:45:07,800
Mom, I'm late. I have to go.

446
00:45:07,800 --> 00:45:09,080
Do Hoon! Do Hoon!

447
00:45:09,080 --> 00:45:12,100
Have a bite! Come on.

448
00:45:14,390 --> 00:45:15,630
See you.

449
00:45:15,630 --> 00:45:19,270
Take care, prosecutor!

450
00:45:22,280 --> 00:45:23,770
By the way...

451
00:45:23,770 --> 00:45:25,940
Did you fix the wiper?

452
00:45:25,940 --> 00:45:30,780
The weather forecast said it won't rain today.

453
00:45:30,780 --> 00:45:34,240
You never worry about anything.

454
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:38,140
I'm going to finish his leftovers.

455
00:45:48,500 --> 00:45:50,100
Why aren't they working?

456
00:45:50,100 --> 00:45:50,880
They're not?

457
00:45:50,880 --> 00:45:52,960
That's strange.

458
00:45:52,960 --> 00:45:54,010
Stay inside, okay?

459
00:45:54,010 --> 00:45:55,320
Okay.

460
00:46:01,730 --> 00:46:03,490
Yes.

461
00:46:04,140 --> 00:46:07,070
Yes, I'm almost there.

462
00:46:07,220 --> 00:46:08,600
Yes.

463
00:46:16,760 --> 00:46:20,990
Min Hyuk went to see that girl.

464
00:46:20,990 --> 00:46:25,430
Bring her back.

465
00:47:06,220 --> 00:47:08,250
I love you.

466
00:48:24,120 --> 00:48:25,670
Do Hoon!

467
00:48:27,690 --> 00:48:29,510
Do Hoon!

468
00:48:29,740 --> 00:48:31,640
I told you to stay inside.

469
00:48:31,640 --> 00:48:33,410
What was it?

470
00:48:40,420 --> 00:48:43,190
Thank god. I was so worried.

471
00:48:43,190 --> 00:48:43,860
Let's go.

472
00:48:43,860 --> 00:48:44,820
Wait.

473
00:48:44,820 --> 00:48:47,980
Let me move it. Other cars might hit it.

474
00:49:01,670 --> 00:49:04,050
Over here, over here.

475
00:49:06,760 --> 00:49:08,720
One, two, three.

476
00:49:08,720 --> 00:49:10,080
Okay.

477
00:49:12,460 --> 00:49:14,250
Go.

478
00:49:37,440 --> 00:49:39,100
Defendant.

479
00:49:39,110 --> 00:49:41,620
Do you plead guilty?

480
00:49:45,480 --> 00:49:47,210
I do.

481
00:50:35,890 --> 00:50:39,970
You look great.

482
00:50:39,970 --> 00:50:41,020
When did you get back?

483
00:50:41,020 --> 00:50:43,010
At dawn.

484
00:50:43,220 --> 00:50:44,980
Is everything ready?

485
00:50:44,980 --> 00:50:48,180
You're not going to regret it?

486
00:50:48,180 --> 00:50:50,290
No. I'll not regret.

487
00:50:50,290 --> 00:50:52,030
Gwang Min.

488
00:50:52,320 --> 00:50:53,570
Min Joo.

489
00:50:53,570 --> 00:50:55,370
Hey!

490
00:50:55,730 --> 00:50:58,000
It's getting late. Let's go.

491
00:50:58,000 --> 00:50:59,260
Okay.

492
00:51:02,940 --> 00:51:05,090
What's going on?

493
00:51:05,090 --> 00:51:08,920
They've been dating while you are abrod..

494
00:51:15,480 --> 00:51:17,400
What's this?

495
00:51:21,790 --> 00:51:24,500
I'll be right there.

496
00:51:25,920 --> 00:51:27,350
So...

497
00:51:30,950 --> 00:51:32,470
Kwang Soo!

498
00:51:34,150 --> 00:51:36,120
Kwang Soo!

499
00:51:46,030 --> 00:51:51,050
I saw Congressman Shin's wife at the boutique yesterday, and she didn't look good.

500
00:51:51,210 --> 00:51:54,160
Congressman Shin isn't going to run for President this time?

501
00:51:54,160 --> 00:51:56,300
Who knows?

502
00:51:56,750 --> 00:52:02,990
Politicians tend to repeat the same mistakes when the situation turns better.

503
00:52:03,130 --> 00:52:05,490
You're not going to go?

504
00:52:05,490 --> 00:52:08,080
It's the inauguration.

505
00:52:08,080 --> 00:52:11,390
Gwang Min will take care of it.

506
00:52:12,080 --> 00:52:13,440
You said you'd consider him as your son.

507
00:52:13,440 --> 00:52:15,910
I guess it's not true.

508
00:52:17,030 --> 00:52:19,980
Do you still want Minyeok to have it?

509
00:52:21,690 --> 00:52:24,070
Min Hyuk has tried his best.

510
00:52:24,070 --> 00:52:27,060
Let him do what he really wants to do.

511
00:52:27,060 --> 00:52:29,120
Mr. Choi...

512
00:52:29,640 --> 00:52:32,520
C.E.O. Choi will do just fine.

513
00:52:33,910 --> 00:52:37,270
Min Hyuk is your only son,

514
00:52:37,270 --> 00:52:39,380
but, what should we do about Min Joo?

515
00:52:39,380 --> 00:52:42,390
Gwang Min's too old for her.

516
00:52:42,390 --> 00:52:45,840
She's insisting on marrying him.

517
00:52:46,420 --> 00:52:49,250
She's just like you.

518
00:52:50,890 --> 00:52:51,570
Sorry?

519
00:52:51,570 --> 00:52:57,060
We've lived for 20 years together.

520
00:53:03,380 --> 00:53:05,190
2008

521
00:53:06,350 --> 00:53:07,910
Your letter.

522
00:53:17,690 --> 00:53:20,530
What is it? You've got a letter.

523
00:53:57,090 --> 00:53:58,930
Pizza buns!

524
00:54:02,450 --> 00:54:04,070
When is your coffee shop going to open?

525
00:54:04,200 --> 00:54:07,840
I'm not ready yet. We have to wait till next month.

526
00:54:07,840 --> 00:54:08,870
I'll sell the coffee.

527
00:54:08,870 --> 00:54:11,570
I've been taking classes to become a barista for that coffee shop.

528
00:54:11,570 --> 00:54:13,390
And you're taking this as an excues not to pay your rent.

529
00:54:16,080 --> 00:54:17,070
Where is Sandra?

530
00:54:17,650 --> 00:54:20,130
Congratulations

531
00:54:20,980 --> 00:54:21,990
Where is Alex?

532
00:54:22,510 --> 00:54:23,690
Is he a pet?

533
00:54:23,690 --> 00:54:25,980
How can you call him like that?

534
00:54:26,610 --> 00:54:30,210
Alex invited you all.

535
00:54:30,210 --> 00:54:32,790
He'll cook a lot of delicious food for you.

536
00:54:33,310 --> 00:54:36,120
Wow, you look prettier with straight hair.

537
00:54:36,120 --> 00:54:38,120
You should've done it earlier.

538
00:54:38,170 --> 00:54:39,350
So what?

539
00:54:39,350 --> 00:54:41,240
Someonw said I would be pretty if I straighten my hair,

540
00:54:41,240 --> 00:54:43,260
but he's now dating with Hae Ri.

541
00:54:43,750 --> 00:54:44,950
Hello.

542
00:54:44,950 --> 00:54:46,060
Speak of the devil.

543
00:54:46,060 --> 00:54:47,410
Hello, Kwang Soo.

544
00:54:47,860 --> 00:54:50,310
What does Alex like?

545
00:54:50,310 --> 00:54:52,400
Streusel bread?

546
00:54:53,300 --> 00:54:54,910
Give me that one, too.

547
00:54:55,210 --> 00:54:56,390
Yummy yummy

548
00:54:58,080 --> 00:54:59,920
It's tasty.

549
00:55:10,760 --> 00:55:12,010
Is the baby coming?

550
00:55:12,050 --> 00:55:13,600
Is the baby coming? Is the baby coming?

551
00:55:14,200 --> 00:55:14,740
What should we do?

552
00:55:14,770 --> 00:55:16,780
- Hospital! Hospital! - What should we do?

553
00:55:16,810 --> 00:55:18,150
- Take her to the hospital. - Kwang Soo!

554
00:55:18,180 --> 00:55:18,920
Oh my god.

555
00:55:18,950 --> 00:55:20,370
Go drive the car.

556
00:55:21,090 --> 00:55:22,210
It's okay. It's okay.

557
00:55:23,390 --> 00:55:25,470
I'll be right there.

558
00:55:25,470 --> 00:55:26,610
Okay.

559
00:55:56,660 --> 00:56:01,330
It's too sweet. I don't like sweet stuff.

560
00:56:06,350 --> 00:56:10,130
I'm not here to see you. I'm here to ask you something.

561
00:56:11,770 --> 00:56:14,850
You made a wish at the pagoda.

562
00:56:15,190 --> 00:56:16,830
What did you wish for?

563
00:56:16,860 --> 00:56:17,910
It's a secret.

564
00:56:17,950 --> 00:56:20,160
This is almost over. No more secrets.

565
00:56:20,190 --> 00:56:22,820
If I tell you the secret, it's not funny.

566
00:56:23,770 --> 00:56:28,480
You like funny stuff.

567
00:56:34,550 --> 00:56:35,940
It's not funny.

568
00:56:36,090 --> 00:56:37,880
I want to know. Just tell me.

569
00:56:38,860 --> 00:56:40,360
No.

570
00:56:40,360 --> 00:56:41,060
Why not?

571
00:56:41,090 --> 00:56:46,750
I'll keep it secret so that you'll keep following me around, sir.

572
00:56:46,750 --> 00:56:48,120
I'm not the C.E.O. anymore.

573
00:56:48,170 --> 00:56:49,110
Really?

574
00:56:49,140 --> 00:56:54,210
Call my name instead of sir.

575
00:56:54,770 --> 00:56:57,120
You still owe me.

576
00:56:57,190 --> 00:57:00,060
Do as I say. Call me by my name.

577
00:57:02,750 --> 00:57:04,610
Min Hyuk.

578
00:57:10,750 --> 00:57:12,200
Again.

579
00:57:13,190 --> 00:57:14,890
Min Hyuk.

580
00:57:16,770 --> 00:57:17,860
Again.

581
00:57:22,500 --> 00:57:24,130
Min Hyuk.

582
00:57:27,010 --> 00:57:28,160
Again.
